    <briefdescription>
<para>Utility routine that copies a subset of data from a larger array into a smaller one using the starting indices and sizes provided. Example usage: </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>call get_array_section( section, array, start, sizes )</para><para>Is equivalent to</para><para>section(:,:,...) = array (start(1):start(1)+sizes(1), start(2):start(2)+sizes(2), ... )</para><para>This interface supports integers and reals for both 4 and 8 kind, and up to 5 dimensions. </para>    </detaileddescription>
